[label=linea] A worn black sneaker steps over a thick painted white border line on wet asphalt at night, the line glowing under a sodium street light and stretching away to both sides into darkness, gritty neon night photography for a dancehall music video, wet streets, sodium orange and electric green light, motion streaks, heavy grain and deep black shadows. Ground-level close-up, the line running across the lower third and the sneaker mid-stride in the center, puddle reflections around it. Sodium orange light from above with an electric green neon glow reflecting in the water, colors of sodium orange, electric green, wet black and white, no text, no watermark.
[label=reja] The diamond shadow pattern of a chain-link fence falls across a towering wall of stacked sound-system speakers at night, the speaker cones vibrating with dust jumping off them, gritty neon night photography for a dancehall music video, wet streets, sodium orange and electric green light, motion streaks, heavy grain and deep black shadows. Medium-wide shot at a slight low angle, the speaker wall filling the frame, the fence itself out of focus in the foreground. Hard sodium light from behind the fence casting the shadow grid, a green neon edge light on the right, colors of sodium orange, electric green and black, no people, no text, no watermark.
[label=carretera] An empty highway at night seen from the hood of a speeding car, headlights and taillights stretched into long streaks of light, the center lines rushing toward the camera, the lights of a border checkpoint glowing far ahead, gritty neon night photography for a dancehall music video, wet streets, sodium orange and electric green light, motion streaks, heavy grain and deep black shadows. Low wide shot from the hood, the road converging to a point in the center. Long-exposure light trails in red and white with sodium orange street lights overhead, colors of sodium orange, red, white and black, no people, no text, no watermark.
[label=mapa] A huge old paper map wheatpasted onto a cracked concrete wall is tearing loose in the wind, one big corner peeling up and fluttering, the border lines on it faded and broken, gritty neon night photography for a dancehall music video, wet streets, sodium orange and electric green light, motion streaks, heavy grain and deep black shadows. Medium shot straight on, the map filling most of the wall, the torn corner lifting on the right. Sodium street light from above and a passing green neon glow, colors of sodium orange, faded paper beige, electric green and black, no people, no text, no watermark.
[label=manos] A packed crowd at a night street dance raises their hands in silhouette against a blinding white strobe and a stack of speakers, haze and sweat catching the light, gritty neon night photography for a dancehall music video, wet streets, sodium orange and electric green light, motion streaks, heavy grain and deep black shadows. Low wide shot from inside the crowd, the raised hands filling the lower half in black silhouette, the strobe bursting in the center. White strobe flare with sodium orange and electric green haze, colors of white, sodium orange, electric green and black, no text, no watermark.
